<title>RUSSIA: Rouble unchanged at 5,407 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble unchanged at 5,407 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble was unchanged at 5,407 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange. Dealers said the central bank sold $1.17 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Oct 1		   Sept 30</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,407		   5,407</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	1.88		    4.10</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
